ESALE CORPORATION ANNOUNCES REAUTHORIZATION OF STOCK REPURCHASE PROGRAM AND QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND', 'text': 'ISSAQUAH, WASH., JAN. 19, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- COSTCO WHOLESALE CORPORATION (“COSTCO” OR THE “COMPANY”) (NASDAQ: COST) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS REAUTHORIZED A COMMON STOCK REPURCHASE PROGRAM OF UP TO $4 BILLION. THIS PROGRAM WILL EXPIRE IN JANUARY 2027 AND REPLACES THE CURRENT $4 BILLION PROGRAM (ADOPTED IN 2019 AND SCHEDULED TO EXPIRE APRIL 2023), UNDER WHICH APPROXIMATELY $1.4 BILLION HAD BEEN PURCHASED. THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS ALSO DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND ON COSTCO COMMON STOCK OF 90 CENTS PER SHARE. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE FEBRUARY 17, 2023, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON FEBRUARY 3, 2023.'}{'symbol': 'DFS', 'date': '2023-01-19 17:49:00', 'title': 'DISCOVER FINANCIAL SERVICES INVESTOR ALERT: SECURITIES LITIGATION PARTNER JAMES (JOSH) WILSON ENCOURAGES INVESTORS WHO SUFFERED LOSSES EXCEEDING $50,000 IN DFS TO CONTACT HIM DIRECTLY TO DISCUSS THEIR OPTIONS', 'text': 'NEW YORK , JAN. 19, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- FARUQI & FARUQI, LLP, A LEADING NATIONAL SECURITIES LAW FIRM, IS INVESTIGATING POTENTIAL CLAIMS AGAINST DISCOVER FINANCIAL SERVICES ("DFS" OR THE "COMPANY") (NYSE: DFS). IF YOU SUFFERED LOSSES EXCEEDING $50,000 INVESTING IN DFS STOCK OR OPTIONS AND WOULD LIKE TO DISCUSS YOUR LEGAL RIGHTS,\xa0CALL FARUQI & FARUQI PARTNER JOSH WILSON DIRECTLY AT 877-247-4292 OR 212-983-9330 \xa0(EXT.'}{'symbol': 'DG', 'date': '2023-01-19 06:55:00', 'title': 'DOLLAR GENERAL EXTENDS FINANCIAL SERVICES WITH IBOTTA PARTNERSHIP', 'text': "GOODLETTSVILLE, TENN.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--TODAY, DOLLAR GENERAL (NYSE: DG) ANNOUNCED A PARTNERSHIP WITH IBOTTA, WHICH WILL EXTEND DOLLAR GENERAL'S FINANCIAL SERVICES AND OFFER CASH BACK OPTIONS TO ALL CONSUMERS."}{'symbol': 'DOV', 'date': '2023-01-19 16:15:00', 'title': 'MARATHON EQUIPMENT INTRODUCES EXPANDED SOLUTIONS FOR WASTE GENERATORS', 'text': 'LEADING WASTE AND RECYCLING EQUIP